= Barcelona, "in Common"?

In a truly commendable project of local and neighbourhood networking and root-based platform building, housing-rights advocate and social activist Ada Colau has kickstarted a new left-wing, anti-austerity political project to dispute the currently CiU-held Barcelona mayorship. bcomu, the new political space, has already gathered the support of ICV-EUiA and Podemos, who have already joined in support, as well as many in the social activism sphere, unions, and other left spaces.

- @post_event: We'll soon see how she fares...